/S /P
/E (Implement a system to detect model drift using Evidently AI and automate feedback-driven retraining processes. This project focuses on identifying when model performance degrades due to changes in data distribution \(data drift\) or relationships between inputs and outputs \(concept drift\). By using tools like Airflow for automation and TensorFlow for retraining, the project ensures continuous model improvement through real-time feedback loops.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
